---
/**
 * The hero's at-a-glance picture: client network → local probe → outbound
 * connection → central hub. Plain HTML so it reflows from a row (wide) to a
 * column (narrow) without a second drawing.
 */
---

<figure class="flow" aria-labelledby="flow-caption">
  <ol class="flow__steps">
    <li class="flow__net">
      <span class="flow__kicker">Client network</span>
      <span class="flow__devices" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>server</span>
        <span>switch</span>
        <span>NAS</span>
      </span>
      <span class="flow__probe">
        <strong>Blentinel probe</strong>
        <span>checks local devices</span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li class="flow__link">
      <span class="flow__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="flow__label">outbound connection</span>
      <span class="flow__no">no inbound rules</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flow__hub">
      <span class="flow__kicker">Central hub</span>
      <strong>dashboard · alerts</strong>
      <span>e.g. on a cloud VPS</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption id="flow-caption" class="visually-hidden">
    A probe inside the client network checks local devices and connects outbound to the central hub.
    The client network needs no inbound firewall rules.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--bt-bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--bt-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .flow__steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .flow__kicker {
    display: block;
    color: var(--bt-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .flow__net {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    border: 1px dashed var(--bt-line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    background: var(--bt-bg);
  }
  .flow__devices {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .flow__devices span {
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--bt-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    color: var(--bt-text-muted);
  }
  .flow__probe,
  .flow__hub {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    background: var(--bt-bg-raised);
    color: var(--bt-text-muted);
  }
  .flow__probe {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--bt-ok);
  }
  .flow__probe strong,
  .flow__hub strong {
    color: var(--bt-text);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .flow__hub {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--bt-accent);
  }
  .flow__hub .flow__kicker {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }
  .flow__link {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    padding: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3) 2.25rem;
    color: var(--bt-accent);
  }
  .flow__line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 1rem;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--bt-accent);
  }
  .flow__line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -7px;
    bottom: -6px;
    border: 6px solid transparent;
    border-top: 8px solid var(--bt-accent);
  }
  .flow__no {
    color: var(--bt-text-muted);
  }
</style>
